{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-primitive-recursive","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","aliases":["57-df-primitive-recursive","57-df-PR"],"depends_on":["[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-closure-operator]]","[[90-df-zero-function]]","[[90-df-successor-function]]","[[90-df-projection-function]]","[[90-df-composition-operator]]","[[90-df-primrec-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-primitive-recursive</span><span>57-df-PR</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e666e28fc8018212\" href=\"?note=e666e28fc8018212\" title=\"90-df-closure-operator\">90-df-closure-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-primitive-recursive-—-Primitive-Recursive-Function-$\\mathrm{PR}$\">df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,S,\\pi_i^n\">\\(Z,S,\\pi_i^n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 仍为一元零函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}\">\\(\\mathrm{Closure}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e666e28fc8018212\" href=\"?note=e666e28fc8018212\" title=\"90-df-closure-operator\">90-df-closure-operator</a>。复合与原始递归见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> 已定义的、在类型不相容输入上返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 的全算子族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为候选有限元数值全函数。此处保留本册的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Base},\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 名称和同一正元基底。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Base}\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\geq1\\land1\\leq i\\leq n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Base}\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\geq1\\land1\\leq i\\leq n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\qquad\nf\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\qquad\nf\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原来把变元数、仅在元数相容时定义的 Comp 与 PrimRec 直接组成一个全算子集合，并不符合所引用的 Closure 输入类型。改用既有的同一操作的类型安全全算子族，不改变类型正确的闭包结果，也不迁移或改写第 90 册定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-primitive-recursive-—-Primitive-Recursive-Function-$\\mathrm{PR}$","text":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function $\\mathrm{PR}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[